# Données d'exemple pour création d'enchères (auctions)

Ce fichier fournit :
- le payload `POST /public/auctions` pour créer une enchère
- la réponse attendue (`CreateAuctionDTO`)

Important : `userId` est la chaîne "1" dans tous les exemples.
Les horodatages utilisent le format UTC/Z (`yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss.SSSZ`).

---

1) CREATE AUCTION AVEC UN NEED ELECTRONIC

Request (payload):
{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-01T09:00:00.000Z",
  "endAt": "2026-08-10T18:00:00.000Z",
  "isActived": true,
  "userId": "1",
  "need": {
    "name": "Recherche smartphone reconditionné",
    "max_price": 200000,
    "quantity": 1,
    "type": "ELECTRONIC",
    "description": "Smartphone 4G minimum, bon état",
    "user_id": "1",
    "photo_urls": [],
    "mandatory_fields": ["brand", "model"],
    "electronic_type": "PHONE",
    "brand": "Apple",
    "model": "iPhone 11",
    "specifications": "{ \"min_ram\": \"4GB\" }",
    "warranty_period": "6"
  }
}

Expected response (200 OK):
{
  "id": 1,
  "ownerId": 1,
  "startedAt": "2026-08-01T09:00:00.000Z",
  "endAt": "2026-08-10T18:00:00.000Z",
  "isActived": true,
  "needName": "Recherche smartphone reconditionné",
  "maxPrice": 200000,
  "currency": "XAF",
  "needQuantity": 1,
  "needDescription": "Smartphone 4G minimum, bon état"
}

